.TH CHM-RUN-COMPAT 1
.SH NAME
chm-run-compat \- select a compatible runtime for an explicitly chosen binary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 tools/binary/run-compat.py
.I BINARY
.RI [ --run ] [ -- ARGS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Selects native ELF execution, QEMU user-mode, Wine, DOSBox, Darling, or Wasmtime/Wasmer when available. Without --run it only prints the proposed command.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --run
Execute the selected file after header inspection. Omit for dry-run.
.SH SAFETY
Does not download binaries or execute files discovered by the recursive scanner. Run only software from trusted sources.
